    "sub_name": "建築計劃",
    "sub_ename": "ARCHITECTURAL PLANNING",
    "describe_ch": "透過了解建築相關(知識)領域之基本架構，解析建築開發過程中，整合各專業領域知識，作為建構建築設計方法與原則之整體前置計劃。",
    "describe_eh": "To understand the basic principle of architecture related knowledge through analyzing the architectural development and process. \r\nIntegrates and utilizes these related professional knowledge, methods and principles as a pre-plan of the architecture design.\r\n",
